  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Updating Metadata and Index**\n\nI\'m now focused on updating `metadata.json` and `index.html`. My main concern is ensuring that I adhere strictly to the environment rule regarding app naming, particularly updating only descriptions for apps that have already been given real, non-placeholder names. I\'m taking extreme care to avoid any potential user confusion.\n\n\n**Refining Description Updates**\n\nI\'m now carefully implementing the updates. In `metadata.json`, I\'m maintaining the original app name: `\"Calculadora de Mitiga\303\247\303\243o de Perdas ColdTrack\"` and the description: \"Safe Meat - Plataforma e landing page institucional de monitoramento IoT e mitiga\303\247\303\243o de perdas log\303\255sticas na cadeia do frio.\" I\'m also addressing the `index.html` update, making sure the title,  `<title>Safe Meat | A Integridade da Cadeia do Frio na Palma da M\303\243o</title>`reflects this. I am now checking all specific instructions for the Landing Page, starting with Animation of Entrance.\n\n\n**Designing the Landing Page**\n\nI\'m now diving into the landing page design. I\'m focusing on a fixed, minimalist header with a blurred backdrop. On the left, I\'m integrating the \"Safe Meat\" text logo with a minimal icon (shield and snowflake, thermometer, or location pin). I\'m carefully using branding colors (navy, cool cyan, crimson). On the right, I\'m adding simple navigation (\"Solution\", \"Mission\", \"About Us\") and a prominent \"Talk to an Expert\" button. I\'m also including a link to the simulator. I am now working on the Hero section, considering a background image or gradient.\n\n\n**Crafting Hero and Mission**\n\nI\'m now implementing the Hero section and Our Mission. I envision a dark, elegant aesthetic recalling technology and logistics, maybe darkened highway trucks with cool telemetry lights. I\'m using \"The Integrity of the Cold Chain at Your Fingertips\" as the title, with \"Smart IoT Monitoring for Meat Transportation\" as the subtitle. I\'m focusing on \"Know the Solution\" (primary, cool neon/blue) and \"See Presentation\" (secondary, refined outline) for the call-to-actions. \"Our Mission\" will use a clean, white background, centered text about ensuring food safety and mitigating financial risks with continuous telemetry. I am also working on Trust pillars now.\n\n\n**Constructing Company Description**\n\nI am now focusing on the \"About Us\" and footer sections. I\'m designing a light gray background with a concise description of our team\'s expertise. We\'re a multidisciplinary team focusing on back-end, cloud computing, and IoT to address logistical challenges. I\'m also including technology badges to highlight our strengths. The footer will be dark, featuring the Safe Meat logo, contact information, and copyright. I\'m adding modal for \"Talk to an Expert\" and \"See Presentation.\"\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 719705557
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
